<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg">
    <title data-en-text="Public API | The Watcher" data-th-text="Public API | The Watcher">Public API | The Watcher</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Search The Watcher network index using the public search API." data-en-content="Search The Watcher network index using the public search API." data-th-content="ค้นหาดัชนีเครือข่าย The Watcher ผ่าน Public Search API">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Prompt:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script src="/js/theme.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/language.js"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css">
</head>

<body class="api-page">
    <%- include('components/navigator') %>
    <main class="shell api-shell">
        <header class="search-heading search-hero">
            <p class="eyebrow" data-en-text="Developer access" data-th-text="สำหรับนักพัฒนา">Developer access</p>
            <h1 data-en-text="Public Search API" data-th-text="Public Search API">Public Search API</h1>
            <p data-en-text="Search hosts and services in The Watcher index. No API key is required." data-th-text="ค้นหาโฮสต์และบริการในดัชนี The Watcher โดยไม่ต้องใช้ API key">Search hosts and services in The Watcher index. No API key is required.</p>
        </header>

        <section class="api-doc-panel queue-panel">
            <p class="eyebrow" data-en-text="Endpoint" data-th-text="ปลายทาง API">Endpoint</p>
            <div class="api-endpoint"><span>GET</span><code>/api/search?search=nginx</code></div>
            <p data-en-text="The endpoint is public and supports cross-origin GET requests." data-th-text="Endpoint นี้เปิดให้เรียกใช้งานสาธารณะ และรองรับ GET จากเว็บไซต์อื่น">The endpoint is public and supports cross-origin GET requests.</p>

            <h2 data-en-text="Query parameters" data-th-text="พารามิเตอร์">Query parameters</h2>
            <div class="index-table-wrap">
                <table class="index-table api-params-table">
                    <thead><tr><th data-en-text="Name" data-th-text="ชื่อ">Name</th><th data-en-text="Required" data-th-text="จำเป็น">Required</th><th data-en-text="Description" data-th-text="คำอธิบาย">Description</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr><td><code>search</code></td><td>Yes</td><td data-en-text="Search term, up to 200 characters. Matches host, IP address, title, and IP range." data-th-text="คำค้นไม่เกิน 200 ตัวอักษร ค้นใน host, IP address, title และ IP range">Search term, up to 200 characters. Matches host, IP address, title, and IP range.</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>service</code></td><td>No</td><td data-en-text="Filter by web, ssh, ftp, or rtsp." data-th-text="กรองตาม web, ssh, ftp หรือ rtsp">Filter by web, ssh, ftp, or rtsp.</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>page</code></td><td>No</td><td data-en-text="1-based page number. Defaults to 1." data-th-text="หมายเลขหน้าเริ่มที่ 1 ค่าเริ่มต้นคือ 1">1-based page number. Defaults to 1.</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>limit</code></td><td>No</td><td data-en-text="Results per page from 1 to 100. Defaults to 50." data-th-text="จำนวนผลลัพธ์ต่อหน้า ตั้งแต่ 1 ถึง 100 ค่าเริ่มต้นคือ 50">Results per page from 1 to 100. Defaults to 50.</td></tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>

            <h2 data-en-text="Example request" data-th-text="ตัวอย่างการเรียกใช้">Example request</h2>
            <pre class="api-code"><code>GET /api/search?search=nginx&amp;service=web&amp;page=1&amp;limit=20</code></pre>

            <h2 data-en-text="Example response" data-th-text="ตัวอย่างผลลัพธ์">Example response</h2>
            <pre class="api-code"><code>{
  "query": { "search": "nginx", "service": "web", "page": 1, "limit": 20 },
  "total": 1,
  "totalPages": 1,
  "results": [
    {
      "ip_range": "192.0.2",
      "host": "http://192.0.2.12/",
      "ip_address": "192.0.2.12",
      "service": "web",
      "port": 80,
      "page_size": 16384,
      "title": "Welcome to nginx!",
      "scanned_at": "2026-10-23T03:00:00.000Z"
    }
  ]
}</code></pre>

            <h2 data-en-text="Response JSON Schema" data-th-text="JSON Schema ของผลลัพธ์">Response JSON Schema</h2>
            <pre class="api-code"><code>{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "SearchResponse",
  "type": "object",
  "required": ["query", "total", "totalPages", "results"],
  "properties": {
    "query": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["search", "service", "page", "limit"],
      "properties": {
        "search": { "type": "string" },
        "service": { "type": ["string", "null"], "enum": ["web", "ssh", "ftp", "rtsp", null] },
        "page": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 },
        "limit": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 100 }
      }
    },
    "total": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
    "totalPages": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
    "results": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["ip_range", "host", "ip_address", "service", "port", "page_size", "title", "scanned_at"],
        "properties": {
          "ip_range": { "type": "string" },
          "host": { "type": "string" },
          "ip_address": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
          "service": { "type": "string", "enum": ["web", "ssh", "ftp", "rtsp"] },
          "port": { "type": "integer" },
          "page_size": { "type": ["integer", "null"], "minimum": 0, "description": "Downloaded response body size in bytes; null when unavailable." },
          "title": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
          "scanned_at": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}</code></pre>

            <p class="api-doc-note" data-en-text="Invalid parameters return HTTP 400 with { &quot;error&quot;: string }. Server errors return HTTP 500 with the same error shape." data-th-text="พารามิเตอร์ไม่ถูกต้องจะตอบ HTTP 400 ในรูปแบบ { &quot;error&quot;: string } ส่วนข้อผิดพลาดจากเซิร์ฟเวอร์ตอบ HTTP 500 ในรูปแบบเดียวกัน">Invalid parameters return HTTP 400 with { "error": string }. Server errors return HTTP 500 with the same error shape.</p>
        </section>
    </main>
</body>

</html>
